  "description": "Use shared AI contracts in middleware, RAG integrations and custom providers without depending on provider SDKs. Defines IAIService, optional Run/request-feature/image interfaces, messages, streaming events, tools, typed image options, AIRunResult, processing-speed observations and immutable model capabilities. Includes identifiers for GPT-6.1 Sol, GPT-6 Sol/Luna, Claude Sonnet 5.5 and Opus 5.5, Grok 4.7 and DeepSeek V4 Pro, plus Perplexity Agent API contracts. Provider execution is supplied by Mythosia.AI 8.2.0. What's New in v4.2.0: additive GPT-6.1 Sol and Claude Sonnet 5.5 model identifiers, plus ClaudeThinkingMode for adaptive and between-tools thinking. Existing public contracts remain compatible. Depends only on the lightweight Mythosia base package.",
